## Do not

- Do not run `flutter pub publish` — it is irreversible
- Do not run `fastlane deliver` / `fastlane supply` without explicit confirmation
- Do not force-push, ever
- Do not rewrite git history (`filter-branch`, `filter-repo`) on a shared branch
- Do not create `.md` files unless asked
- Do not write explanatory comments in code — only the non-obvious "why"
- Do not apply migrations directly against production
- Do not bump the Flutter SDK constraint without asking; it changes the minimum
  OS versions your users need
